GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: bearer 1GTWhoT3jHxqIs4jMiLS0g==



### LOGOUT
# ATTENTION: Don't forget to login and update the token in the auth-header
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/logout
